{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++", "description": "This source file implements an MLIR pass for coarsening device mesh clusters in TensorFlow's DTensor framework. It contains logic to identify clusters with the same device mesh attribute and merge them to optimize device placement and execution. The code defines several utility functions for cluster merging, including merging cluster results, updating operand usages, and creating new merged clusters. The main pass iterates over cluster operations in the IR and applies these merging strategies.", "external_files": ["absl/status/status.h", "llvm/ADT/STLExtras.h", "llvm/ADT/SmallVector.h", "llvm/Support/Casting.h", "llvm/Support/LogicalResult.h", "mlir/Dialect/Func/IR/FuncOps.h", "mlir/IR/Attributes.h", "mlir/IR/Block.h", "mlir/IR/Builders.h", "mlir/IR/Diagnostics.h", "mlir/IR/Operation.h", "mlir/IR/Types.h", "mlir/IR/ValueRange.h", "mlir/Pass/Pass.h", "mlir/Support/LogicalResult.h", "tensorflow/compiler/mlir/tensorflow/ir/tf_device.h", "tensorflow/dtensor/cc/constants.h", "tensorflow/dtensor/mlir/layout_parsing.h", "tensorflow/dtensor/mlir/dtensor_passes.h.inc"], "external_methods": ["ExtractDeviceMeshFromOp", "absl::StatusMessageAsCStr"], "published": ["CreateDTensorDeviceMeshClusterCoarsening"], "classes": [{"name": "DTensorDeviceMeshClusterCoarsening", "description": "MLIR pass class that performs coarsening of device mesh clusters by merging clusters with identical mesh attributes."}], "methods": [{"name": "void runOnOperation()", "description": "Main execution method of the MLIR pass, iterates over blocks and merges device mesh clusters with the same attribute.", "scope": "tensorflow::dtensor::DTensorDeviceMeshClusterCoarsening", "scopeKind": "struct"}, {"name": "std::unique_ptr<mlir::OperationPass<mlir::func::FuncOp>> CreateDTensorDeviceMeshClusterCoarsening()", "description": "Factory function that creates an instance of the cluster merging pass.", "scope": "tensorflow::dtensor", "scopeKind": "namespace"